cturer = Illumina</a></li><li>function: <span title=\"Codes:{https://www.medizininformatik-initiative.de/fhir/ext/modul-mtb/CodeSystem/mii-cs-mtb-genomicanalysis-devicefunction library-preparation-kit}\">Library-Preparation Kit</span></li></ul></blockquote><p><b>Genomic Study Analysis Genome Build</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{http://loinc.org LA26806-2}\">GRCh38</span></p><p><b>status</b>: Completed</p><p><b>category</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/observation-category laboratory}\">Laboratory</span></p><p><b>subject</b>: <a href=\"https://simplifier.net/resolve?scope=de.basisprofil.r4@1.5.4&amp;canonical=http://fhir.org/packages/de.basisprofil.r4/Patient/example\">Patient/example</a></p></div>"
